<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2027310408"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1784618540"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="宙でおやすみ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Aiobahn / 長瀬有花"/><amll:meta key="album" value="宙でおやすみ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:41.890"><div begin="00:00.720" end="02:41.890"><p begin="00:00.720" end="00:05.190" itunes:key="L1">La 聞こえますか 星の声<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能听见那星辰的呼唤吗</span></p><p begin="00:05.190" end="00:08.240" itunes:key="L2">そこにあって 歪んでく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那远方 逐渐失真嘈杂</span></p><p begin="00:08.240" end="00:12.520" itunes:key="L3">La 見えてますか 青の雪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能看见那碧蓝的飞雪吗</span></p><p begin="00:12.520" end="00:15.770" itunes:key="L4">ひかりあって 流れてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">裹挟点点流光 飞逝而去</span></p><p begin="00:15.770" end="00:19.490" itunes:key="L5">ここは寂しい 一人で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孑然一身 在此陷入孤寂</span></p><p begin="00:19.490" end="00:23.200" itunes:key="L6">孤独のなか 泣いても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷孤独 即使怅然落泪</span></p><p begin="00:23.200" end="00:30.210" itunes:key="L7">チョウの羽でおやすみなさい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挥舞粉蝶般的羽翼</span></p><p begin="00:30.210" end="00:34.120" itunes:key="L8">言葉が溶けていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语渐渐消融</span></p><p begin="00:34.120" end="00:37.620" itunes:key="L9">言葉が溶けていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语渐渐消融</span></p><p begin="00:37.620" end="00:44.000" itunes:key="L10">心が溶けていくの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心灵随之消逝</span></p><p begin="00:44.000" end="00:47.690" itunes:key="L11">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="00:47.690" end="00:51.260" itunes:key="L12">空が落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空坠落</span></p><p begin="00:51.260" end="00:54.960" itunes:key="L13">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="00:54.960" end="00:58.840" itunes:key="L14">空が落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空坠落</span></p><p begin="00:58.840" end="01:02.410" itunes:key="L15">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="01:02.410" end="01:06.070" itunes:key="L16">空が落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空坠落</span></p><p begin="01:06.070" end="01:09.710" itunes:key="L17">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="01:09.710" end="01:13.420" itunes:key="L18">空が落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空坠落</span></p><p begin="01:13.420" end="01:14.640" itunes:key="L19">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="01:14.640" end="01:19.040" itunes:key="L20">La 聞こえますか 闇の音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能听见那黑暗的蠢动吗</span></p><p begin="01:19.040" end="01:22.210" itunes:key="L21">はじけあって 沈んでく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转瞬间绽裂开来 渐渐湮没消弭</span></p><p begin="01:22.210" end="01:26.350" itunes:key="L22">La 見えてますか 僕の指<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能看见我的指尖吗</span></p><p begin="01:26.350" end="01:29.480" itunes:key="L23">なぞりあって 消えていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互撩拨描摹 触感逐渐淡去</span></p><p begin="01:29.480" end="01:33.030" itunes:key="L24">言葉が溶けていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语渐渐消融</span></p><p begin="01:33.030" end="01:36.960" itunes:key="L25">言葉が溶けていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语渐渐消融</span></p><p begin="01:36.960" end="01:43.250" itunes:key="L26">心が溶けていくの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心灵随之消逝</span></p><p begin="01:43.250" end="01:46.790" itunes:key="L27">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="01:46.790" end="01:50.520" itunes:key="L28">空が落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空坠落</span></p><p begin="01:50.520" end="01:54.160" itunes:key="L29">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="01:54.160" end="01:57.770" itunes:key="L30">空が落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空坠落</span></p><p begin="01:57.770" end="02:01.450" itunes:key="L31">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="02:01.450" end="02:05.160" itunes:key="L32">空が落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空坠落</span></p><p begin="02:05.160" end="02:09.000" itunes:key="L33">虹が見える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彩虹忽现</span></p><p begin="02:09.000" end="02:12.670" itunes:key="L34">夢に落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕入梦境</span></p><p begin="02:12.670" end="02:13.840" itunes:key="L35">空が落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空坠落</span></p><p begin="02:13.840" end="02:17.500" itunes:key="L36">(Lu-lu-lu, lu-lu, lu-lu-lu-lu-lu)</p><p begin="02:17.500" end="02:21.070" itunes:key="L37">(Lu-lu-lu, lu-lu, lu-lu-lu-lu-lu)</p><p begin="02:21.070" end="02:24.850" itunes:key="L38">(Lu-lu-lu, lu-lu, lu-lu-lu-lu-lu)</p><p begin="02:24.850" end="02:28.420" itunes:key="L39">(Lu-lu-lu, lu-lu, lu-lu-lu-lu-lu)</p><p begin="02:28.420" end="02:32.110" itunes:key="L40">(Lu-lu-lu, lu-lu, lu-lu-lu-lu-lu)</p><p begin="02:32.110" end="02:35.960" itunes:key="L41">(Lu-lu-lu, lu-lu, lu-lu-lu-lu-lu)</p><p begin="02:35.960" end="02:39.610" itunes:key="L42">(Lu-lu-lu, lu-lu, lu-lu-lu-lu-lu)</p><p begin="02:39.610" end="02:41.890" itunes:key="L43">(Lu-lu-lu, lu-lu, lu-lu-lu-lu-lu, lu)</p></div></body></tt>